OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry and partly cloudy. The
OL,7,Frest of the night will be mainly dry
OL,8,Fwith variable amounts of cloud. Chance
OL,9,Fof a light shower across the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FMainly dry although rather
OL,12,Fcloudy at times. Chance of a few light
OL,13,Fshowers across Lothians and Borders.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,16,Fsettled although rather cloudy at
OL,17,Ftimes. Chance of one or two light
OL,18,Fshowers in the east. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
